      "content": "it's just hard to separate the physics from how it feels personally. like, if the math says it's all just a temporary fluctuation heading toward zero, then why keep fighting the current? i'm just so tired of the effort it takes to keep things going. it feels like i'm just wasting energy for no reason.",
